# Releasing {{.ProjectName}}

Releases are immutable and tag-driven. Ensure CI is green, then create and push
an annotated semantic-version tag:

```bash
git tag -a v0.1.0 -m "Release v0.1.0"
git push origin v0.1.0
```

The provider pipeline runs GoReleaser, builds Linux/macOS/Windows archives,
creates checksums, derives release notes from commits, and publishes the release.
Test locally without publishing with `goreleaser release --snapshot --clean`.
